  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pxj7](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pxj7) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 109.388 depth occurred on May 06 2025 51km S of Lénakel. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -19.9786 longitude 169.3572. It impacted 9725 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
